@startuml c-current
!pragma layout smetana
left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
title Current C domain (19bd091)
package "D: ui" {
  class GameMenu
  class FileDialogs
}
package "B: application" {
  class GameController
}
package "C: persistence" {
  class BoardFileStore {
    {static} openForLoad(File): InputStream
    {static} openForStore(File): OutputStream
  }
  class LegacyLifeCodec {
    {static} load(NeighborhoodState, InputStream)
    {static} flush(NeighborhoodState, OutputStream)
  }
}
package "A: model" {
  interface Cell {
    createMemento(): NeighborhoodState
    transfer(Memento, Point, boolean)
  }
  interface "Cell.Memento" as Memento
  class NeighborhoodState {
    liveCells(): Collection
    replaceCells(Collection)
  }
}
GameMenu --> FileDialogs : select path
GameMenu --> GameController : load / store
GameController --> BoardFileStore : open
GameController --> LegacyLifeCodec : decode / encode
GameController --> Cell : capture / restore
LegacyLifeCodec --> NeighborhoodState : read / replace
NeighborhoodState ..|> Memento
Cell ..> NeighborhoodState
note bottom of GameController
Owns stop / clear / restore and close.
Close is currently on success path only.
end note
note bottom of LegacyLifeCodec
Java serialized Collection<Point>.
No preset API in current code.
end note
@enduml
